 <!-- document-body -->
 
+## Call assistant
+
+**Today → Call assistant** prepares agency/customer service inquiries, speaks typed text and prepared phrases in Korean beside a separate speakerphone, and optionally records this device's microphone. Save notes, replay recordings, and delete the record and audio. Automatic AI replies and transcription are future work. [Usage and implementation limits (Korean)](docs/call-assist.md).
+
 ## My sentences and easing tension
 
 **Training → Sentence practice → Read my sentence twice** accepts reviewed text or OCR, keeps dated A/B recordings with individual AI feedback, and plays both sequentially for comparison. Recording/playback work offline; AI requires a configured model/server and upload consent.
